  "description": "DESXAB crystallizes in the tetragonal crystal system with space group P -4 21 c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C60 H132 Ce4 O12,8(C7 H8). From the CIF bond table, Ce1 (Ce) has 5 O neighbors; Ce1C (Ce) has 5 O neighbors; Ce1A (Ce) has 5 O neighbors; Ce1B (Ce) has 5 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 4 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.811-3.811 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 105.17-107.40°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C60H132Ce4O12.",
